    {
      "id": "clm:05e558c990bd1f715a56210432ff8067da782e3a965d61303df477a3220b9e30",
      "text": "For a non-image record, the recipient logs the new no-op and updates the session transaction record in one write unit of work under write-conflict retry, using the same wall-clock time and without setting the persisted transaction-state field. The transaction participant requires an active write unit of work, writes the session table without an extra replicated write, and registers its statement-cache update for commit. An image alone does not advance the session transaction record. (high confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mongodb/mongo/dacdbc3df2fbe579b03336a2f01fc9aedf406a41/src/mongo/db/s/session_catalog_migration_destination.cpp",
