    {
      "id": "clm:9700d81af162baaa0858d64227e2c6f9e598b8d7a7b4defdb4016a2b84e6aa38",
      "text": "In the initial migration path, MigrationDestinationManager constructs the session worker with its cancellation token and starts it during initial bulk clone. startCommit requires steady state and a matching migration session before calling finish. After document-mod draining, the migration thread joins the session worker without holding the outer session; a worker error fails migration before recipient recovery persistence and critical-section acquisition. (low confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mongodb/mongo/dacdbc3df2fbe579b03336a2f01fc9aedf406a41/src/mongo/db/s/migration_destination_manager.cpp",
      "also": [
