    {
      "id": "clm:054ec64b7096bc0a138097f18013a7a97cf1145b96d8c6d9a2c952df220d5544",
      "text": "The donor cloner constructs its session-history source only in replica-set mode. It initializes and primes session transfer in startClone. Before asking the recipient to commit, it signals onCommitCloneStarted. After recipient success, remaining session history produces SessionTransferIncomplete; cancellation signals cleanup. (low confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mongodb/mongo/dacdbc3df2fbe579b03336a2f01fc9aedf406a41/src/mongo/db/s/migration_chunk_cloner_source.cpp",
